er/src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx)\n  - [`src/screens/CadenceSettingsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/CadenceSettingsScreen.tsx)\n  - [`src/screens/AnalyticsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/AnalyticsScreen.tsx)\n  - [`src/screens/SettingsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/SettingsScreen.tsx)\n- 🗄️ **Database & Repositories:**\n  - [`src/db/database.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/database.ts) (Universal SQLite + Web Local Storage)\n  - [`src/db/leadsRepository.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/leadsRepository.ts)\n  - [`src/db/callLogsRepository.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/callLogsRepository.ts)\n  - [`src/db/cadenceRepository.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/cadenceRepository.ts)\n  - [`src/db/settingsRepository.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/settingsRepository.ts)\n- ⚙️ **Services & Navigation:**\n  - [`src/services/visionService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/visionService.ts)\n  - [`src/services/telephonyService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/telephonyService.ts)\n  - [`src/services/cadenceEngine.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/cadenceEngine.ts)\n  - [`src/navigation/AppNavigator.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/navigation/AppNavigator.tsx)\n\nIf you refresh your web browser at `http://localhost:8081`, you can test and explore every single screen, feature, and workflow immediately!","truncated_fields":["content"]}
